{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年43歲的藝人梁靖琪（Toby）於2019年與圈外男友施雋賢（Jonathan）結婚，婚後育有大仔施睿文（Roman）及細仔施睿安（Rian），一家四口生活幸福美滿。</p><p>兩夫妻經常在社交平台分享親子日常，更為7歲Roman開設個人社交平台帳戶</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T20:24:16.668337+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T20:01:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T20:17:32.280218+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T20:17:32.280218+00:00","content_hash":"ec1807c34e92db121527c4569f22634f9150dfcb49f1f6a5c5d77d256618aa47","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}